<section class="card" aria-labelledby="workspaceOperationsTitle">
 <div class="cardHead"><div><b id="workspaceOperationsTitle">Wallets &amp; daily operations</b><br><span>Set up once, then use your configured accounts</span></div></div>
 <div class="cardBody workspaceGuide">
  <ol class="workspaceGuideSteps">
   <li><b>Set up accounts</b><p>Use Quick setup to create your first branch and its real cash or float accounts. Account codes are generated automatically.</p></li>
   <li><b>Confirm actual opening</b><p>The owner checks real counted cash or a provider statement and confirms a first routine opening in one audited action. Discrepancies still require separate reconciliation.</p></li>
   <li><b>Choose defaults</b><p>Save the default wallet, payment accounts and fee treatment. Configure fees and commissions once; daily entries calculate the matching charge automatically.</p></li>
   <li><b>Fund and reconcile</b><p>Open a business account to add money or check its balance. Transfers between existing eligible accounts post immediately.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="tiny">Daily transactions use your assigned operating branch. The administrator branch selector changes the records being viewed.</p>
  <div class="workspaceActions"><% if(user.role==='Tenant Owner'){ %><a class="btn btnPrimary" href="/tenant/setup">Quick setup</a><% } %><a class="btn" href="/tenant/treasury">Business funds</a><% if(data.canManage){ %><a class="btn" href="/tenant/workspace/pricing">Fees &amp; commissions</a><% } %><% if(data.canObserveFunds){ %><a class="btn" href="/tenant/treasury#add-funds">Transfer funds</a><% } %><% if(data.canReviewFunds){ %><a class="btn" href="/tenant/treasury/review">Review balances</a><% } %></div>
 </div>
</section>
